  m_text: '1  Collect water: cross the bridge to the well, hold to fill the jug,
    then carry it home. It only counts once it''s home.

    2  Cook food: at the
    fire by the caravans, tap to stir the pot.

    3  Teach the children: at the
    tent, tap to answer the children''s questions.

    4  Work online: at the caravan
    screen, tap to send work. The connection sometimes drops.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
